---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){const pages={about:{title:'About Goa, Considered',description:'Why this independent guide exists and how its research is presented.',heading:'About Goa, Considered',body:['Goa, Considered is an independent hotel discovery guide. It helps travellers compare where to stay by region, property style, facilities and trade-offs.','This first edition is a research-based editorial selection drawn from public sources, especially official hotel pages and government tourism information. The site has not visited or audited the listed properties.','We do not operate a booking engine, sell rooms, show live availability or claim that this selection is exhaustive. We link to official hotel sites so readers can confirm changing details.']},methodology:{title:'Selection methodology',description:'How hotels were researched, shortlisted and ordered for this Goa guide.',heading:'How we selected these ten',body:['We started with a 21-property discovery pool spanning North, South and central Goa, including resorts, independent boutique hotels and full-service properties. Candidate names came from official hospitality portfolios, government tourism information and independent travel coverage.','A property was retained where current official property information could be located, its region and property type could be established, and it added a distinct use case to the shortlist. We checked official pages on 25 October 2026.','The order is an editorial reading order, not a measured rank. The available public evidence does not support fair numeric scoring across all candidates: comparable independent reputation data, rate observations and inspection evidence are missing or inconsistent. We do not claim visits, audits, user ratings or objective proof of “best.”','Facilities and locations are subject to change. Readers should verify details, room terms, access, seasonality and transport directly with each hotel. Candidate pool: Taj Fort Aguada Resort & Spa; Ahilya by the Sea; ITC Grand Goa; Taj Exotica Resort & Spa; Taj Holiday Village Resort & Spa; Ronil Goa; The Park Calangute; The Westin Goa; W Goa; The St. Regis Goa Resort; Courtyard by Marriott Goa Colva; Alila Diwa Goa; Beleza by the Beach; Casa Jaali; The Postcard Velha; The Postcard Saligao; The Postcard Hideaway, Netravali; Cidade de Goa; Amrapali • House of Grace; Panaji Residency; and Calangute Residency. Eleven candidates are discovery leads, not assessed exclusions.']},'editorial-policy':{title:'Editorial policy',description:'Our fact-checking, corrections and commercial independence policy.',heading:'Editorial policy',body:['We write for travellers making a real location and property choice. Hotel descriptions are original and distinguish published facts from our editorial interpretation. Material facts link to a source, preferably the property’s official website.','We do not fabricate firsthand experience, ratings, review counts, prices, awards, accreditation, partnerships or commercial relationships. No affiliate links or paid placements are present in this initial release.','This prototype has no published editorial review schedule or monitored corrections channel. No visitor-report process is active. The source-check dates in hotel records document the research recorded for this release; they are updated only when a source is actually checked. Before launch, define a review cadence and configure a working contact route before inviting corrections.']},'sources-and-corrections':{title:'Sources and corrections',description:'How to suggest an update to property facts in this Goa hotel guide.',heading:'Sources and corrections',body:['Material property details are linked from each hotel profile. Official pages are the primary source for current property names, facilities and addresses. Government tourism sources inform regional and accommodation context; independent publications inform discovery and search-intent research.','Last research check: 25 October 2026. Hotel information can change between checks. To suggest a correction, contact route is not configured in this prototype; a monitored correction channel must be added before publication. Do not publish a fabricated email address.']},contact:{title:'Contact',description:'Contact the editors about property corrections, sources or site feedback.',heading:'Contact',body:['This prototype does not yet have a monitored contact channel. Add and verify one before publication. Do not use an unmonitored or invented address. For corrections, include the relevant page and an authoritative source.']},'privacy-policy':{title:'Privacy policy',description:'Privacy information for the Goa, Considered static directory.',heading:'Privacy policy',body:['This prototype is a static informational website. It does not include user accounts, analytics, advertising, embedded third-party media or a booking form. Comparison selections are stored locally in your browser only when you use the compare controls.','The site does not send those selections to a server. External hotel links open the hotel’s own site, which may apply its own privacy policy. Update this policy if analytics, forms, affiliate links, advertising or other data collection is added.']}};
return Object.keys(pages).map(page=>({params:{page},props:{page:pages[page as keyof typeof pages]}}));}
const {page}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`${page.title} | Goa, Considered`} description={page.description}><div class="wrap content"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / {page.title}</p><p class="kicker">Transparency</p><h1>{page.heading}</h1>{page.body.map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}<p>Go back to the <a href="/">hotel shortlist</a>.</p></div></Base>
